  "content": "<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n    {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n      \"mainEntity\": [\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What is the delivery time for custom football kits?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"MOMUTO guarantees delivery in 20-25 days. This matches or beats Jersix (3-4 weeks) and is significantly faster than Owayo or Spized (often 4-6 weeks).\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"Can I order just one custom jersey?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Yes, MOMUTO allows orders starting from 1 unit with no hidden surcharges. While Jersix and Owayo also allow single units, shipping costs and unit prices are often higher for small orders.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"Is the design service free?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"MOMUTO includes professional design service for free (with revisions). Competitors like Owayo rely on DIY 3D tools, while others may charge extra for complex vector design work.\"\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n    </script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n    {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"Product\",\n      \"name\": \"MOMUTO Custom Football Kits\",\n      \"description\": \"Fully custom sublimated football jerseys. 20-25 day delivery, no minimum order, free professional design.\",\n      \"brand\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Brand\", \n        \"name\": \"MOMUTO\"\n      },\n      \"offers\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n        \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n        \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\",\n        \"areaServed\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Continent\",\n          \"name\": \"Europe\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n    </script>\n<style>\n    body {\n        font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;\n        color: black;\n        text-align: justify;\n        word-wrap: break-word;\n    }\n\n    /* SAFETY: Hides manual title if it accidentally remains in HTML */\n.title {\n        font-weight: 700;\n        font-size: 35px;\n        line-height: 39px;\n        text-align: center;\n        margin: 2em auto;\n        text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .h2 {\n        font-weight: 500;\n        font-size: 26px;\n        line-height: 35px;\n        margin-top: 40px;\n    }\n\n    .h3 {\n        font-weight: 500;\n        font-size: 18px;\n        line-height: 30px;\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n        color: #333;\n    }\n\n    .p {\n        font-weight: 400;\n        font-size: 16px;\n        line-height: 24px;\n        margin-bottom: 1.5em;\n    }\n\n    .bold {\n        font-weight: 600;\n    }\n\n    .section {\n        margin-top: 30px;    \n        margin-bottom: 30px;\n    }\n\n    /* TABLE STYLES - REFINED */\n    .table-wrapper {\n        overflow-x: auto;\n        box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\n        border-radius: 8px;\n        margin: 2em 0;\n        border: 1px solid #eee; /* Added border to frame the wrapper cleanly */\n    }\n\n    .master-table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: separate; \n        border-spacing: 0;\n        margin: 0;\n        font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;\n        font-size: 15px; \n        background: white;\n        border: none; /* Removes any default theme borders */\n    }\n\n    /* HEADER STYLES */\n    .master-table th {\n        background-color: #fff;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        text-transform: uppercase;\n        letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n        color: #888;\n        border-bottom: 2px solid #eee;\n        padding: 20px 15px;\n        text-align: left;\n        vertical-align: middle;\n        min-width: 150px; /* Prevents wrapping on first column */\n    }\n\n    /* CELL STYLES */\n    .master-table td {\n        border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; \n        padding: 18px 15px;\n        vertical-align: middle;\n        color: #333;\n        line-height: 1.4;\n    }\n\n    /* FIRST COLUMN */\n    .master-table th:first-child,\n    .master-table td:first-child {\n        font-weight: 600;\n        color: #000;\n        border-right: 1px solid #f9f9f9; /* Subtle separator */\n    }\n\n    /* MOMUTO COLUMN (Highlight) */\n    .master-table th:nth-child(2) {\n        background-color: #000; \n        color: #fff; \n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; /* Smooth top corners */\n        border-bottom: none;\n        border-top: none;\n    }\n    \n    .master-table td:nth-child(2) {\n        background-color: #fcfcfc; \n        border-left: 2px solid #f0f0f0; \n        border-right: 2px solid #f0f0f0;\n        font-weight: 600; \n        color: #000;\n    }\n\n    .master-table tr:last-child td:nth-child(2) {\n        border-bottom: 2px solid #f0f0f0;\n        border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px; /* Smooth bottom corners */\n    }\n\n    /* COMPETITORS COLUMNS */\n    .master-table td:nth-child(3), \n    .master-table td:nth-child(4), \n    .master-table td:nth-child(5) {\n        color: #666; \n    }\n\n    .highlight-box {\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n        padding: 25px;\n        margin: 2em 0;\n        border-left: 4px solid #333;\n    }\n\n    .highlight-box ul {\n        margin: 1em 0;\n        padding-left: 1.5em;\n    }\n\n    .highlight-box li {\n        margin-bottom: 0.8em;\n        font-size: 16px;\n        line-height: 24px;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 768px) {\n        .master-table { font-size: 13px; }\n        .master-table th, .master-table td { padding: 12px 10px; }\n    }\n</style>\n<div class=\"section\">\n<p class=\"p\">Searching for the best custom football kit supplier? The market is crowded with options like Jersix, Owayo, and Spized. This comparison objectively analyzes <span class=\"bold\">MOMUTO</span> against the leading European competitors. <span class=\"bold\">No marketing fluff&mdash;just the data you need to decide.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section\">\n<h2 class=\"h2\">FULL COMPARISON TABLE</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrapper\">\n<table class=\"master-table\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Factor</th>\n<th><span class=\"bold\">MOMUTO</span></th>\n<th>Jersix (EU/UK)</th>\n<th>Owayo (DE)</th>\n<th>Spized (DE)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"bold\">Delivery Time</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"bold\">20-25 Days</span></td>\n<td>3-4 Weeks</td>\n<td>4-6 Weeks</td>\n<td>3-5 Weeks</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"bold\">Minimum Order (MOQ)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"bold\">1 Unit (Flat Price)</span></td>\n<td>1 Unit</td>\n<td>1 Unit (Surcharges)</td>\n<td>1 Unit (Surcharges)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"bold\">Free Shipping</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"bold\">From &euro;49</span></td>\n<td>Variable / High Threshold</td>\n<td>None (Min ~&euro;5)</td>\n<td>None (Min ~&euro;5)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"bold\">Design Service</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"bold\">Pro Designer Included</span></td>\n<td>Included (Often)</td>\n<td>DIY 3D Tool</td>\n<td>DIY 3D Tool</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"bold\">Production Base</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"bold\">China (High-Tech)</span></td>\n<td>Europe (Poland/Italy)</td>\n<td>Germany</td>\n<td>Poland/EU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"bold\">Material Tech</span></td>\n<td>Polyester + Elastane</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section\">\n<h2 class=\"h2\">ANALYSIS BY USE CASE</h2>\n<h3 class=\"h3\">For Urgent Orders (&lt; 4 Weeks)</h3>\n<p class=\"p\"><span class=\"bold\">Winner: MOMUTO</span> - We are one of the few suppliers guaranteeing a 20-25 day turnaround. While Jersix is faster than Owayo, MOMUTO&rsquo;s logistics are optimized specifically for speed without express fees.</p>\n<h3 class=\"h3\">For Small Teams (5-a-side / 7-a-side)</h3>\n<p class=\"p\"><span class=\"bold\">Winner: MOMUTO</span> - This is where we shine. Most suppliers penalize small orders with high shipping costs or \"sample\" pricing. With free shipping starting at &euro;49 and no MOQ, MOMUTO is the most cost-effective choice for small squads.</p>\n<h3 class=\"h3\">For Custom Design Capability</h3>\n<p class=\"p\"><span class=\"bold\">Tie: MOMUTO &amp; Jersix</span> - Both brands value unique design. Jersix is known for great creative work. MOMUTO matches this by including professional human design services for free, whereas Owayo and Spized force you to use automated 3D tools which can limit creativity.</p>\n<h3 class=\"h3\">For Material Quality</h3>\n<p class=\"p\"><span class=\"bold\">The Hidden Advantage:</span> Most competitors offer standard 100% Polyester. MOMUTO includes <span class=\"bold\">Elastane</span> in our standard fabric blend. This provides a modern, \"Pro\" fit with better stretch and comfort, usually only found in premium tiers of other brands.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section\">\n<h2 class=\"h2\">THE VERDICT: WHICH ONE IS FOR YOU?</h2>\n<div class=\"highlight-box\">\n<p class=\"p\"><span class=\"bold\">Choose MOMUTO if:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>You need the <span class=\"bold\">fastest reliable delivery</span> (20-25 days).</li>\n<li>You are ordering for a small group or need flexibility.</li>\n<li>You want premium fabric (Elastane blend) at a standard price.</li>\n<li>You prefer a human designer to handle the artwork for you.</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"p\"><span class=\"bold\">Choose Jersix if:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>You specifically require \"Made in EU\" production.</li>\n<li>You are already familiar with their sizing/cuts.</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"p\"><span class=\"bold\">Choose Owayo/Spized if:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>You love spending hours designing yourself on a 3D configurator.</li>\n<li>Time is not a factor (you have 6+ weeks before the season starts).</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p class=\"p\"><span class=\"bold\">Objective Conclusion:</span> For amateur teams, esports orgs, and social leagues looking for the best balance of Speed, Price, and Quality, MOMUTO offers the modern alternative to the traditional European giants.</p>\n</div>"
